<p class="fs-4" style="text-align: justify;">
By the time the females return, most often the chicks are about a week or two old. And by now their appetites have also grown. The mama penguins feed the chicks regurgitated, digested seafood. For now, the male and the female will take turns to go hunt, but it is not long before they leave the chick on land to go hunt together. During times like this, the chicks that do not yet have their waterproof fluff and fat to keep them warm huddle up with each other to survive.<br>
